**The known events.** `data/known_events.csv`: {{ v('events.known.events') }} events in
{{ v('events.known.rows') }} rows, each with an onset, an end and a citation. For each row the own
backend is fit on the year before a window of ten days either side of the event, so the residuals
in the window are those of a model that has seen nothing after each origin. Detected
{{ v('events.known.detected') }} of {{ v('events.known.rows') }} ({{ v('events.known.recall') }}), median
